-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §107: §104's non-academic first deputies are
-- converted by the academic first deputy's rules.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `107 ההמרה`

@ref akn:art_107
GIVEN `a first deputy of section 104` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `converted by the first deputies' rules` `a first deputy of section 104` IF
    `a first deputy of section 104`
